right up to the area
where the deceased disappeared.

965
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:41,720
The area where the body was found.

966
00:56:41,800 --> 00:56:45,120
They were there the same time
the culprit committed the crime.

967
00:56:45,200 --> 00:56:48,560
{\an8}WATCHARINS KONGKANTAW
"BAM'S FATHER," VILLAGER

968
00:56:49,240 --> 00:56:52,080
I looked at the field to the side

969
00:56:52,160 --> 00:56:54,040
