970
00:56:55,120 --> 00:56:57,640
MAY 11, 2020
9:00-10:00 A.M. - DAY OF DISAPPEARANCE

971
00:57:00,680 --> 00:57:04,280
I saw him lurking around and wondered why.

972
00:57:04,360 --> 00:57:05,840
It felt strange.

973
00:57:07,480 --> 00:57:09,200
I went to talk to him.

974
00:57:13,760 --> 00:57:17,600
I asked, "Did Father Ohm ask you
to come and tap the rubber trees?"

975
00:57:17,680 --> 00:57:19,000
That's the owner.

976
00:57:19,080 --> 00:57:20,720
He went still. Yeah, he just froze.

977
00:57:20,800 --> 00:57:24,720
But in my case, I had a witness,
but I couldn't mention them in the news.

978
00:57:24,800 --> 00:57:26,640
This witness saw the culprit,

979
00:57:26,720 --> 00:57:29,040
but the police asked me
not to mention them,

980
00:57:29,120 --> 00:57:32,240
so I told the station
that this person was a key witness.

981
00:57:32,320 --> 00:57:35,160
The police asked us
not to report them, so we didn't.

982
00:57:35,240 --> 00:57:38,360
While they were cutting wood,
they saw someone carrying the child.

983
00:57:38,440 --> 00:57:41,200
They saw them walking
from behind the child's house,

984
00:57:41,280 --> 00:57:42,720
passing the bamboo bush.

985
00:57:42,800 --> 00:57:45,600
But the police asked us
to keep quiet, so we did.

986
00:57:46,120 --> 00:57:47,680
Who was carrying her?

987
00:57:48,320 --> 00:57:51,400
The suspect was. 

988
00:57:53,280 --> 00:57:55,520
I pay homage to Buddha.

989
00:57:56,280 --> 00:57:59,360
I'm focused on myself.
Am I worried about other people?

990
00:57:59,440 --> 00:58:00,280
Yeah, of course I am.

991
00:58:02,440 --> 00:58:04,480
I can also tell you
about Bam's father's incident.

992
00:58:04,560 --> 00:58:05,400
And so I…

993
00:58:05,480 --> 00:58:07,960
<i>Bam's father's story</i>
<i>is very important to the case.</i>

994
00:58:08,040 --> 00:58:11,400
<i>He is an actual witness</i>
<i>and never retracted his testimony.</i>

995
00:58:11,480 --> 00:58:14,560
After seeing the news with Bam's father…

996
00:58:16,360 --> 00:58:19,560
…the next day, I rode my motorcycle
to Bam's father's house.

997
00:58:19,640 --> 00:58:21,000
It was just across from mine.

998
00:58:21,080 --> 00:58:23,520
I asked him if he could
remember things accurately

999
00:58:23,600 --> 00:58:25,320
and to tell the reporters that way.

1000
00:58:27,560 --> 00:58:31,480
People around him were displeased with me.

1001
00:58:32,160 --> 00:58:35,320
They tried to make me scared.
Really scared.

1002
00:58:36,080 --> 00:58:37,920
They came to my house at night…

1003
00:58:41,880 --> 00:58:44,560
…trying to hit me with an iron bar.

1004
00:58:44,640 --> 00:58:46,360
They also took out a knife…

1005
00:58:47,400 --> 00:58:48,760
to stab me.

1006
00:58:50,840 --> 00:58:53,680
But I was on my guard,
ready to fight them.

1007
00:58:53,760 --> 00:58:57,360
They also got scared
and yelled at me before leaving.

1008
00:59:00,920 --> 00:59:04,080
After you found out
that the police suspected Uncle Phol,

1009
00:59:04,160 --> 00:59:05,920
how did they tell you to wait?

1010
00:59:09,040 --> 00:59:11,760
I wanted him arrested, but we had to wait.

1011
00:59:12,400 --> 00:59:15,560
If they were to arrest him,
they had to find evidence to tie him down,

1012
00:59:15,640 --> 00:59:17,720
so he couldn't get away and fight.

1013
00:59:18,400 --> 00:59:19,600
I waited for evidence.

1014
00:59:20,360 --> 00:59:22,000
Are you ready? One, two, three.

1015
00:59:22,080 --> 00:59:23,480
Change poses.

1016
00:59:27,800 --> 00:59:29,000
In Chompoo's case,

1017
00:59:29,080 --> 00:59:33,960
we and the police officers had to confirm
that we had forensic evidence

1018
00:59:34,040 --> 00:59:37,240
proving Uncle Phol's involvement.

1019
00:59:37,320 --> 00:59:38,400
Let's take photos…

1020
00:59:38,480 --> 00:59:40,680
The police came to inspect his car,

1021
00:59:40,760 --> 00:59:42,800
which Chompoo often sat in.

1022
