It was common for her
to take rides in his car.

1023
00:59:48,880 --> 00:59:51,480
When the police came
and asked to inspect my car,

1024
00:59:51,560 --> 00:59:53,720
I opened the doors on both sides.

1025
00:59:54,240 --> 00:59:58,160
I pulled the windscreen wipers up,
then I stood next to the car.

1026
00:59:58,240 --> 01:00:00,440
I let them do whatever they wanted to do.

1027
01:00:00,520 --> 01:00:02,880
"You want to inspect the car?
Go right ahead."

1028
01:00:08,480 --> 01:00:11,400
They got in the car
and inspected this and that.

1029
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:12,960
They did their job,

1030
01:00:13,040 --> 01:00:16,280
while I stood there
with my arms crossed and watched them,

1031
01:00:16,360 --> 01:00:18,720
