going to do with me.

1032
01:00:18,800 --> 01:00:19,720
Did you get it?

1033
01:00:19,800 --> 01:00:22,240
-It's enough.
-Take some photos too.

1034
01:00:24,240 --> 01:00:25,680
What about the middle part?

1035
01:00:25,760 --> 01:00:28,120
I didn't think
what they were doing was right.

1036
01:00:29,000 --> 01:00:31,960
I don't know
where they collected those hairs from,

1037
01:00:32,040 --> 01:00:34,160
but the locations
where they were collected

1038
01:00:34,240 --> 01:00:35,920
were reported in the news.

1039
01:00:38,760 --> 01:00:43,640
They were all dressed in their uniforms
and put the yellow tape around the area.

1040
01:00:43,720 --> 01:00:46,240
I was freaked out
by what they were interested in.

1041
01:00:49,040 --> 01:00:52,800
They asked me which outfit I wore
to tap rubber trees on the 11th.

1042
01:00:53,400 --> 01:00:55,760
I couldn't remember
because it was a long time ago,

1043
01:00:55,840 --> 01:00:57,760
and I didn't pay attention
to the clothes I wore.

1044
01:00:58,920 --> 01:01:02,440
I wore whatever was available,
so I couldn't remember.

1045
01:01:03,520 --> 01:01:05,560
I never cleaned my car's interior.

1046
01:01:05,640 --> 01:01:07,440
How was I supposed to verify the facts?

1047
01:01:07,520 --> 01:01:10,520
I had no idea
what they had brought and collected.

1048
01:01:10,600 --> 01:01:12,800
They didn't tell me where they got it.

1049
01:01:12,880 --> 01:01:15,800
Why didn't they let me look at it?
What were they afraid of?

1050
01:01:17,040 --> 01:01:19,240
<i>One of the hairs found in Uncle Phol's car</i>

1051
01:01:19,320 --> 01:01:24,040
<i>had a cut angle and side surface</i>
<i>that matched two strands of Chompoo's hair</i>

1052
01:01:24,120 --> 01:01:27,400
<i>which were collected from the area</i>
<i>where her body was found.</i>

1053
01:01:27,480 --> 01:01:30,880
<i>At least three strands were found</i>
<i>in Uncle Phol's car.</i>

1054
01:01:32,160 --> 01:01:34,360
Hold on. I'll also send this photo along.

1055
01:01:34,440 --> 01:01:35,480
PHYSICAL EVIDENCE

1056
01:01:35,560 --> 01:01:38,240
It's like a rope.
All the evidence and witnesses,

1057
01:01:38,320 --> 01:01:40,880
including hair,
they're all important threads

1058
01:01:40,960 --> 01:01:43,120
