01:01:50,240 --> 01:01:54,320
The hair strands found in the car
and from the crime scene

1061
01:01:54,400 --> 01:01:56,640
were cut with the same knife.

1062
01:01:56,720 --> 01:01:57,720
That's the main point.

1063
01:01:57,800 --> 01:02:00,120
{\an8}MAPPING KIT
CALIBRATION/SYSTEM

1064
01:02:00,200 --> 01:02:03,120
The police used
a forensic machine called a synchrotron.

1065
01:02:07,120 --> 01:02:11,320
<i>This machine is</i>
<i>a synchrotron light generator.</i>

1066
01:02:11,400 --> 01:02:13,640
<i>It's a very large machine.</i>

1067
01:02:14,400 --> 01:02:17,840
<i>Synchrotron light emits</i>
<i>radiation as X-ray,</i>

1068
01:02:17,920 --> 01:02:22,200
<i>and the radiation is much more intense</i>
<i>than ordinary radiation.</i>

1069
01:02:22,280 --> 01:02:26,280
<i>Therefore, the analysis</i>
<i>can be very detailed.</i>

1070
01:02:27,720 --> 01:02:28,600
Synchrotron.

1071
01:02:29,200 --> 01:02:31,520
Chompoo's hair at the scene was cut,

1072
01:02:31,600 --> 01:02:34,800
and more hairs were found
