1074
01:02:38,200 --> 01:02:40,040
Therefore, they believe

1075
01:02:40,120 --> 01:02:43,600
Uncle Phol might have been
with Chompoo when she died.

1076
01:02:43,680 --> 01:02:45,040
THE TEAM IS THOROUGH

1077
01:02:45,120 --> 01:02:48,640
IT'S HARD FOR HIM TO GET AWAY WITH IT
WHEN THERE'S FORENSIC EVIDENCE LIKE THIS

1078
01:03:01,720 --> 01:03:04,160
Back then, we didn't understand
why he cut it.

1079
01:03:07,080 --> 01:03:09,520
Villagers told me he did black magic.

1080
01:03:09,600 --> 01:03:11,280
It's to seal the soul.

1081
01:03:15,600 --> 01:03:16,880
Based on our understanding…

