1089
01:03:41,080 --> 01:03:43,120
There are things like this.

1090
01:03:43,200 --> 01:03:44,640
It could be this.

1091
01:03:44,720 --> 01:03:46,760
There are many, many motives.

1092
01:03:47,280 --> 01:03:49,440
Is it possible that he took Chompoo

1093
01:03:49,520 --> 01:03:52,200
or her shirt with him to do something?

1094
01:03:52,280 --> 01:03:55,280
If it's really about black magic,
then I think it's possible,

1095
01:03:55,360 --> 01:03:59,200
if I were to take it from the perspective
of us rural Northeastern people.

1096
01:04:01,760 --> 01:04:04,440
There should be
something on the shirt to help identify

1097
01:04:04,520 --> 01:04:06,160
the perpetrator.

1098
