For example, I took the child away.

1116
01:05:07,600 --> 01:05:10,240
I was afraid
people would find out that I did it,

1117
01:05:10,320 --> 01:05:11,760
so I had to take off her clothes

1118
01:05:11,840 --> 01:05:14,520
