had been dragged away and raped.

1119
01:05:15,560 --> 01:05:18,280
<i>Everything was well-planned, you see?</i>

1120
01:05:18,360 --> 01:05:23,880
<i>They took off the child's clothes</i>
<i>to disguise it as a sexual assault,</i>

1121
01:05:23,960 --> 01:05:26,360
<i>so they can blame it on someone else.</i>

1122
01:05:27,200 --> 01:05:30,960
From the news, I felt
that people didn't believe it at first.

1123
01:05:33,440 --> 01:05:36,920
Because he seemed
like an ordinary country person,

1124
01:05:37,000 --> 01:05:38,760
living a country life.

1125
01:05:38,840 --> 01:05:40,480
He probably wouldn't do any harm.

1126
01:05:40,560 --> 01:05:44,040
And more importantly,
he was Chompoo's uncle or something,

1127
01:05:44,120 --> 01:05:45,640
and he was close to her.

1128
01:05:49,640 --> 01:05:52,680
Just take a look. Take a real good look.

1129
01:05:53,280 --> 01:05:56,080
Could an uncle do this to his niece?

1130
01:05:56,160 --> 01:05:57,840
Why would he go that far?

1131
01:05:57,920 --> 01:06:00,200
What's the motive? What's the reason?

1132
