1136
01:06:13,640 --> 01:06:15,560
<i>Before Chompoo's case,</i>

1137
01:06:15,640 --> 01:06:18,440
<i>the family did have</i>
<i>conflict with each other.</i>

1138
01:06:20,640 --> 01:06:22,600
I COULD TELL IT WAS ABOUT MONEY.

1139
01:06:22,680 --> 01:06:25,440
THEY PICKED SIDES
NOT OUT OF MORALITY BUT OUT OF GREED.

1140
01:06:27,960 --> 01:06:32,080
If it's about debt,
he was the one who owed me money.

1141
01:06:32,160 --> 01:06:35,720
He borrowed it and wouldn't return it,
so I had to follow up.

1142
01:06:35,800 --> 01:06:39,160
I didn't owe him anything.
He was the one who owed me.

1143
01:06:41,120 --> 01:06:46,120
Are you aware of any serious conflict
that's ever happened between the families?

1144
01:06:46,200 --> 01:06:48,400
{\an8}No, nothing serious has ever happened.

1145
01:06:48,480 --> 01:06:49,880
{\an8}CHARN LARBPHO
CHOMPOO'S GRANDFATHER

