1166
01:08:02,920 --> 01:08:05,400
<i>Uncle Phol's wife also faced charges.</i>

1167
01:08:05,480 --> 01:08:07,720
<i>Aunt Taen was charged with two charges,</i>

1168
01:08:07,800 --> 01:08:11,440
