1170
01:08:14,200 --> 01:08:17,600
<i>Second, she's the co-conspirator</i>
<i>in committing the offense.</i>

1171
01:08:18,960 --> 01:08:21,240
Hey, this case was getting strange.

1172
01:08:21,320 --> 01:08:23,640
I thought,
"Why do I have an arrest warrant?"

1173
01:08:25,560 --> 01:08:29,120
I went to the police to surrender myself
