1174
01:08:30,640 --> 01:08:31,920
Uncle Phol.

1175
01:08:34,360 --> 01:08:37,360
<i>Well, this is not</i>
<i>something we see very often.</i>

1176
01:08:37,440 --> 01:08:38,320
<i>Yes.</i>

1177
01:08:38,400 --> 01:08:41,560
<i>A suspect being flown</i>
<i>in a police helicopter.</i>

1178
01:08:44,960 --> 01:08:48,320
They treated me
as if I was this big-time drug dealer.

1179
01:08:51,040 --> 01:08:54,440
{\an8}ROYAL THAI POLICE

1180
01:08:55,560 --> 01:08:57,440
The police escorted me on a helicopter.

1181
