1183
01:09:07,640 --> 01:09:10,400
They let me carry the keys
and took photos with me for memories.

1184
01:09:11,360 --> 01:09:14,080
"Gosh! I like you." Something like this.

1185
01:09:16,520 --> 01:09:19,280
Don't push. Calm down. Don't push.

1186
01:09:19,360 --> 01:09:20,400
Turn left.

1187
01:09:21,800 --> 01:09:23,680
I was in a cell on the second day.

1188
01:09:24,320 --> 01:09:26,440
My first time ever being locked up.

1189
01:09:26,520 --> 01:09:31,040
And on the second day,
I sang the song "The Truth in My Heart."

1190
01:09:31,120 --> 01:09:34,440
<i>I was accused of the wrongdoing </i>

1191
01:09:34,520 --> 01:09:38,080
<i>Oh dear, what a life</i>

