<i>Taking good care of you</i>

1193
01:09:42,000 --> 01:09:43,960
<i>While you're still here</i>

1194
01:09:44,560 --> 01:09:46,680
A police officer who was there went…

1195
01:09:50,080 --> 01:09:53,440
Instead of stopping me,
"Hey, you're a suspect."

1196
01:09:53,520 --> 01:09:54,360
"You're a prisoner."

1197
01:09:54,440 --> 01:09:56,760
The YouTubers are down there
and tried to capture me singing.

1198
01:09:56,840 --> 01:09:59,000
"Hey, Phol is singing. Come see!"

1199
01:09:59,520 --> 01:10:03,680
DECEMBER 20, 2023

1200
01:10:05,880 --> 01:10:09,200
Today, the Mukdahan Court
of First Instance scheduled

1201
01:10:09,280 --> 01:10:11,760
{\an8}the reading of the verdict
in Chompoo's case.

1202
01:10:11,840 --> 01:10:15,560
As for the latest update,
the court has passed a verdict.

1203
01:10:17,960 --> 01:10:21,880
When they read the verdict,
I nudged my lawyer next to me.

1204
01:10:21,960 --> 01:10:26,120
"Hey, Pan, what sentence am I facing?
Wasn't the case dismissed?"

1205
01:10:26,200 --> 01:10:28,840
The lawyer said, "Hold on.
Calm down, Phol."

1206
01:10:28,920 --> 01:10:30,480
"You're facing a sentence."

1207
01:10:31,280 --> 01:10:34,440
I started crying.
I couldn't hold back my tears.

1208
01:10:35,360 --> 01:10:37,720
I really didn't know
I was facing a sentence.

1209
01:10:38,840 --> 01:10:41,600
IN THAILAND, THERE IS NO PUBLIC REGISTER
FOR THE RULINGS

1210
01:10:41,680 --> 01:10:44,480
OF THE COURT OF FIRST INSTANCE
OR THE COURT OF APPEAL.

1211
01:10:44,560 --> 01:10:46,000
ACCORDING TO MEDIA COVERAGE,

1212
01:10:46,080 --> 01:10:49,400
THE MUKDAHAN PROVINCIAL COURT
SENTENCED PHOL TO 20 YEARS IN PRISON,

1213
01:10:49,480 --> 01:10:52,720
RULING HIM GUILTY UNDER SECTIONS 291
AND 317 OF THE CRIMINAL CODE

1214
01:10:52,800 --> 01:10:55,160
FOR NEGLIGENCE,
CAUSING ANOTHER PERSON'S DEATH,

1215
01:10:55,240 --> 01:10:59,920
AND ABDUCTING A CHILD AGED 15 OR UNDER
FROM HER PARENTS WITHOUT REASONABLE CAUSE.

1216
01:11:00,000 --> 01:11:03,760
ALL CHARGES AGAINST TAEN WERE DISMISSED.

1217
01:11:03,840 --> 01:11:07,600
PHOL SAID HE WOULD FILE AN APPEAL.

1218
01:11:12,080 --> 01:11:13,760
This is a very special case.

1219
01:11:13,840 --> 01:11:17,760
In all my 20 years working as a lawyer,
I've never seen a case like this.

1220
01:11:17,840 --> 01:11:20,840
If it's a case involving murder
or a serious crime,

1221
01:11:20,920 --> 01:11:23,680
most of the time,
the court will imprison them.

1222
01:11:23,760 --> 01:11:25,440
The court released him on bail.

1223
01:11:25,520 --> 01:11:27,320
What do we do now?

1224
01:11:27,400 --> 01:11:28,920
Hello, hello.

1225
01:11:29,000 --> 01:11:30,320
-Hello.
-Hello.

1226
01:11:30,400 --> 01:11:33,240
<i>Uncle Phol looked</i>
<i>like he was about to cry,</i>

1227
01:11:33,320 --> 01:11:37,920
<i>but he also said that he accepts</i>
<i>the ruling of the Court of First Instance.</i>

1228
01:11:38,000 --> 01:11:42,680
<i>He said that he accepts the order</i>
<i>and the rest is up to his lawyer's team.</i>

1229
01:11:42,760 --> 01:11:46,200
I'm still wondering
how the hairs ended up in my car.

1230
01:11:46,280 --> 01:11:48,880
But if the hairs that were collected…

1231
01:11:49,520 --> 01:11:51,720
If they were really Chompoo's hairs,

1232
01:11:51,800 --> 01:11:54,040
then I tried to tell them
and my lawyer's team

1233
01:11:54,120 --> 01:11:56,480
that my car was never washed,

1234
01:11:56,560 --> 01:11:58,640
and that Chompoo used to ride
in my car all the time.

1235
01:11:59,800 --> 01:12:03,240
The reporters saw that I've been fighting
over the forensic reports.

1236
01:12:03,320 --> 01:12:05,760
The hair strand analyzed and the cut mark.

1237
01:12:05,840 --> 01:12:08,200
I don't know what they mean
by "the cut mark."

1238
01:12:08,280 --> 01:12:11,400
<i>Here is an announcement</i>
<i>from Boem, Uncle Phol's lawyer.</i>

1239
01:12:11,480 --> 01:12:15,240
The hair strand is biological material,

1240
01:12:15,320 --> 01:12:19,960
unlike ordinary materials,
non-biological matter.

1241
01:12:20,040 --> 01:12:23,240
I don't know how long
that the hairs were stored

1242
01:12:23,320 --> 01:12:26,960
before they were put
under the Synchrotron and magnified,

1243
01:12:27,040 --> 01:12:29,720
but scientifically, that's unreliable.

1244
01:12:29,800 --> 01:12:35,160
The evidence could become contaminated
by someone else, or degraded over time.

1245
01:12:44,720 --> 01:12:46,160
AUGUST 12, 2025

1246
01:12:46,240 --> 01:12:47,480
If I'm being honest…

1247
01:12:47,560 --> 01:12:48,920
THE DAY BEFORE PHOL'S APPEAL

1248
01:12:49,000 --> 01:12:50,840
…I think about it all the time.

1249
01:12:51,400 --> 01:12:54,240
The memories are always in my head.

1250
01:12:54,320 --> 01:12:57,320
When I think about it,
I always-- I always cry.

1251
01:12:58,560 --> 01:13:00,040
If I could turn back time,

1252
01:13:00,120 --> 01:13:02,160
I would give anything, anything,

1253
01:13:02,240 --> 01:13:05,160
just to spend some more time
with my daughter.

1254
01:13:07,120 --> 01:13:10,680
Because she was only with me for…

1255
01:13:13,000 --> 01:13:16,000
for three years and two months.

1256
01:13:19,040 --> 01:13:20,960
It was so short.

1257
01:13:23,720 --> 01:13:30,320
MUKDAHAN
ISAN REGION, THAILAND

1258
01:13:39,760 --> 01:13:41,080
I'm prepared for the worst.

1259
01:13:41,840 --> 01:13:44,240
It's like there are two people
in one body.

1260
01:13:44,320 --> 01:13:48,040
One asking, "If this is the outcome,
will you accept it?"

1261
01:13:48,560 --> 01:13:52,120
The other side of me can accept it
because I've already prepared for it.

1262
01:13:52,200 --> 01:13:53,840
I've prepared for the pain.

1263
01:13:53,920 --> 01:13:55,080
Yet…

1264
01:13:56,320 --> 01:13:59,840
I just can't figure out
what the motive was,

1265
01:13:59,920 --> 01:14:03,080
what he was thinking, how he did it,

1266
01:14:03,160 --> 01:14:05,000
or what he did it for.

1267
01:14:05,520 --> 01:14:08,080
What's your name? Stack them.

1268
01:14:08,160 --> 01:14:10,600
Go get it downstairs.
Use it instead of a pencil.

1269
01:14:10,680 --> 01:14:11,640
Now. Now.

1270
01:14:11,720 --> 01:14:14,920
I want this to be
the last case like this ever.

1271
01:14:15,000 --> 01:14:17,080
I want justice to be served.

1272
01:14:21,560 --> 01:14:23,160
-Can you walk?
-Yes.

1273
01:14:23,240 --> 01:14:24,480
Can you walk?

1274
01:14:24,560 --> 01:14:28,000
I think Uncle Phol's case will be a lesson

1275
01:14:28,080 --> 01:14:30,240
many people will need to learn.

1276
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:37,000
This includes how the justice system
in our country has changed.

1277
01:14:37,880 --> 01:14:39,480
The truth won't emerge

1278
01:14:40,080 --> 01:14:44,800
if social media court is allowed
to meddle with facts in the case.

1279
01:14:47,120 --> 01:14:49,800
Uncle Phol's case is
a very good example of it.

1280
01:14:49,880 --> 01:14:51,880
Even lawyers like me were shocked.

1281
01:14:56,800 --> 01:15:00,320
I would like to tell journalists
who are hungry for news,

1282
01:15:00,400 --> 01:15:02,800
or do not care about the news they get,

1283
01:15:02,880 --> 01:15:06,560
wait until this happens
to you or your own families

1284
01:15:06,640 --> 01:15:11,080
and you'll understand how difficult it is
to bear the consequences.

1285
01:15:11,160 --> 01:15:15,320
How powerful
do you think social media has become?

1286
01:15:15,400 --> 01:15:17,200
It's very powerful.

1287
01:15:20,480 --> 01:15:23,400
When we create YouTube videos
or similar media,

1288
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:26,600
we have to accept the consequences.

1289
01:15:26,680 --> 01:15:29,960
We have to do it well
and think before we say something.

1290
01:15:30,040 --> 01:15:32,440
Because once our words
are out on social media,

1291
01:15:32,520 --> 01:15:34,160
we can't take them back.

1292
01:15:34,240 --> 01:15:36,600
Every word has a price to pay.

1293
01:15:39,400 --> 01:15:41,200
She was like a little angel

1294
01:15:41,280 --> 01:15:43,840
who unfortunately only lived
for a short time,

1295
01:15:43,920 --> 01:15:45,680
but I knew it could help me make money.

1296
01:15:46,400 --> 01:15:48,800
I won't deny that I got famous from here.

1297
01:15:48,880 --> 01:15:51,120
I got famous from Chompoo's case.

1298
01:15:54,080 --> 01:15:56,400
I have never met you,

1299
01:15:57,520 --> 01:15:59,160
but I have seen your photos.

1300
01:15:59,240 --> 01:16:03,160
In your next life,
I wish you happiness, with loving parents,

1301
01:16:03,240 --> 01:16:06,720
and free from harm
of cruel and evil people.

1302
01:16:06,800 --> 01:16:08,160
To this day,

1303
01:16:09,120 --> 01:16:12,120
all the coverage was damn pointless.

1304
01:16:12,200 --> 01:16:17,000
It's like it came and went by,
and that's it.

1305
01:16:17,080 --> 01:16:22,600
Everything is now the past.
And what's next?

1306
01:16:25,960 --> 01:16:30,720
AUGUST 13, 2025
UNCLE PHOL'S APPEAL VERDICT

1307
01:16:45,840 --> 01:16:49,440
The story behind Chompoo's murder
is complicated.

1308
01:16:50,400 --> 01:16:54,000
Full of secrets, and has ended up
going through the justice system.

1309
01:16:55,200 --> 01:16:58,240
This story is a long and epic tale,

1310
01:16:58,920 --> 01:17:00,120
starting in 2020…

1311
01:17:00,200 --> 01:17:02,160
What did he do it for? Look!

1312
01:17:02,240 --> 01:17:05,800
…and continuing right up until now,
in 2025.

1313
01:17:13,640 --> 01:17:15,560
How do you feel? Relaxed?

1314
01:17:15,640 --> 01:17:18,160
Well, I'm nervous.

1315
01:17:18,240 --> 01:17:20,680
-You're nervous. I get it.
-Nervous. I'm nervous.

1316
01:17:20,760 --> 01:17:23,400
Well, as you can see,
I've had to wait for today

1317
01:17:23,480 --> 01:17:25,560
for the courts to read the verdict.

1318
01:17:25,640 --> 01:17:27,560
It's been a very difficult time.

1319
01:17:28,960 --> 01:17:30,760
-Let's wait and see.
-Okay.

1320
01:17:30,840 --> 01:17:33,720
We should hear some good news
this afternoon.

1321
01:17:35,080 --> 01:17:36,640
I've fought until today

1322
01:17:36,720 --> 01:17:39,800
because I just want
my family to get justice,

1323
01:17:39,880 --> 01:17:43,200
like other families
whom justice has served.

1324
01:17:46,280 --> 01:17:48,000
Don't shout. Keep quiet.

1325
01:17:48,080 --> 01:17:50,520
I came to support Uncle Phol.

1326
01:17:51,160 --> 01:17:54,200
So why are you still his fan?

1327
01:17:54,280 --> 01:17:57,600
Well, he's a kind-hearted person.

1328
01:18:01,280 --> 01:18:03,680
Even though many things have happened,

1329
01:18:03,760 --> 01:18:07,960
with people insulting and accusing
Uncle Phol and Aunt Taen,

1330
01:18:08,040 --> 01:18:11,160
the remaining YouTubers
still have faith in them.

1331
01:18:11,240 --> 01:18:16,240
We have seen his actions and behavior
since we started living in Kok Kork.

1332
01:18:18,600 --> 01:18:22,040
If we don't see
Uncle Phol come out at noon,

1333
01:18:22,120 --> 01:18:25,120
it means the court
must have already sentenced him.

1334
01:18:31,000 --> 01:18:33,920
{\an8}…the epic case of Uncle Phol,

1335
01:18:34,000 --> 01:18:38,880
{\an8}who is accused of causing the death
of the three-year-old girl Chompoo.

1336
01:18:38,960 --> 01:18:41,840
Today we have the verdict
from the Appeals Court.

1337
01:18:41,920 --> 01:18:45,360
They have increased the sentence
for Uncle Phol.

1338
01:18:50,520 --> 01:18:53,680
The Court of Appeals has increased
the sentence to 26 years.

1339
01:18:53,760 --> 01:18:55,440
I think I'm going to faint.

1340
01:18:55,520 --> 01:18:57,880
<i>The Mukdahan Provincial Court read</i>

1341
01:18:57,960 --> 01:19:01,480
<i>the verdict</i>
<i>of the Court of Appeals Region 4.</i>

1342
01:19:01,560 --> 01:19:07,560
<i>The court sentenced Mr. Chaiphol Whipha,</i>
<i>the first defendant, on all three charges.</i>

1343
01:19:07,640 --> 01:19:11,600
<i>Fifteen years imprisonment</i>
<i>for murder with oblique intent,</i>

1344
01:19:11,680 --> 01:19:15,640
<i>ten years imprisonment for abducting</i>
<i>a child under 15 years of age</i>

1345
01:19:15,720 --> 01:19:16,960
<i>from her parents.</i>

1346
01:19:17,040 --> 01:19:18,480
<i>And for tampering with the corpse</i>

1347
01:19:18,560 --> 01:19:20,840
<i>at the crime scene</i>
<i>where the body was found,</i>

1348
01:19:20,920 --> 01:19:23,280
<i>he will be sentenced</i>
<i>to one year in prison.</i>

1349
01:19:23,360 --> 01:19:26,440
<i>That brings the total</i>
<i>to 26 years imprisonment.</i>

1350
01:19:26,520 --> 01:19:28,040
CHOMPOO HAS RECEIVED JUSTICE

1351
01:19:28,120 --> 01:19:30,680
-Keep fighting!
-Look at this camera.

1352
01:19:31,680 --> 01:19:35,280
Everyone who came here
couldn't eat or sleep.

1353
01:19:35,360 --> 01:19:37,400
I don't even know what to say.

1354
01:19:37,480 --> 01:19:39,800
We did our best. Well…

1355
01:19:58,520 --> 01:20:01,240
-I'm rooting for you.
-Come on. Let's go together.

1356
01:20:01,320 --> 01:20:03,280
-I'm rooting for you.
-Okay.

1357
01:20:03,360 --> 01:20:06,480
-Do you feel better now?
-Keep fighting.

1358
01:20:06,560 --> 01:20:07,680
Yes, yeah, that's good.

1359
01:20:07,760 --> 01:20:09,240
What's your name?

1360
01:20:09,320 --> 01:20:10,360
I cried.

1361
01:20:11,600 --> 01:20:14,920
The punishment is more severe this time.

1362
01:20:16,800 --> 01:20:20,680
I would like to thank everyone
working on Chompoo's case.

1363
01:20:20,760 --> 01:20:22,640
She has received justice this time.

1364
01:20:22,720 --> 01:20:25,960
There will be friends coming.

1365
01:20:26,040 --> 01:20:27,560
I feel…

1366
01:20:28,080 --> 01:20:31,400
I was just so happy,
I was shaking and crying.

1367
01:20:35,800 --> 01:20:38,960
This is something I've been waiting
a long time for.

1368
01:20:39,040 --> 01:20:40,640
After they found my child's body,

1369
01:20:40,720 --> 01:20:43,120
the police carried out
an investigation and…

1370
01:20:44,880 --> 01:20:46,080
we had to wait.

1371
01:20:46,160 --> 01:20:50,320
We waited two years, three years,
four years, five years.

1372
01:20:50,920 --> 01:20:55,120
And now, finally,
Chompoo has received justice.

1373
01:21:09,120 --> 01:21:12,360
I'm not satisfied.
I'm very sad for what he did to our child.

1374
01:21:15,040 --> 01:21:18,480
I want to tell those who have been
following this news from the beginning,

1375
01:21:18,560 --> 01:21:20,960
don't just believe
everything you see and hear.

1376
01:21:21,040 --> 01:21:23,200
It takes time to get to the truth.

1377
01:21:23,280 --> 01:21:27,320
And to the media out there,
who turned a suspect into a celebrity,

1378
01:21:27,840 --> 01:21:31,040
remember you have
a professional obligation

1379
01:21:31,120 --> 01:21:32,600
to report the truth.

1380
01:21:36,320 --> 01:21:38,280
I hope this is the last case like this.

1381
01:21:38,960 --> 01:21:41,280
We can't turn criminals into celebrities.

1382
01:21:42,840 --> 01:21:44,920
We can't let this happen again.

1383
01:21:49,760 --> 01:21:52,920
I told my daughter, may she rest in peace.

1384
01:21:54,360 --> 01:21:56,960
May she become an angel in heaven.

1385
01:22:04,120 --> 01:22:07,440
AFTER THE VERDICT
FROM THE COURT OF APPEAL,

1386
01:22:07,520 --> 01:22:12,280
BOTH PHOL AND THE PROSECUTOR
STILL HAVE ONE LAST CHANCE

1387
01:22:12,360 --> 01:22:15,920
TO APPEAL TO THAILAND'S SUPREME COURT